-- Add comments for documentation
COMMENT ON DATA member_levels IS 'Initial member levels: Principiante (0 XP), Intermedio (500 XP), Avanzado (1500 XP), Elite (3000 XP)';
COMMENT ON DATA achievements IS 'Initial achievements covering tournament wins, participation, social events, and milestones';
COMMENT ON DATA club_info IS 'Initial club information in Spanish. Can be updated by admins through the admin dashboard.';
